  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung demands his sons tell him what they have been doing.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now, tell your old father what you have been about!\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"I have been busy, and I have set up a great house for myself,\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) They are silent and they do not answer.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Have you been doing this and that and nothing to show for it, you little dogs!\"",
